# a list of licenses as "OR", so only MIT is listed below.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "das_wavefront_picker"
version: 3.0.1
date-released: "2026-11-04"
abstract: >-
  das_wavefront_picker detects candidate wavefronts in continuous Distributed
  Acoustic Sensing (DAS) data with a multichannel STA/LTA (Method A: simple
  channel count; Method B: wavefront tracking), then lets the user pick,
  refine and label each wavefront interactively on its own raw-DAS waterfall
  and saves one HDF5 file per wavefront. Version 3 adds a channel-quality
  (bad-channel) workflow: a static quality scan that produces a channel mask
  for detection, and an event-level confidence gate in the picker.
authors:
